HISTORY d behind one another, followed by the triplets for the nextorder, etc.  HISTORY  If no orders have been skipped or deslected in theextraction process,  HISTORY  the contents of aperture Y in order X can befound as follows:lambda =  HISTORY  array[*,0,( X - (smallest ordernumber))*naps + (Y-1)], flux   = array  HISTORY [*,1,( X - (smallest ordernumber))*naps + (Y-1)], error  = array[*,2,(  HISTORY  X - (smallest ordernumber))*naps + (Y-1)]  For example, for an SXD fi  HISTORY le with twoapertures, the wavelength array for aperture 1 in order 3 i  HISTORY s locatedin array [*,0,0], the flux is in array [*,1,0] and the error   HISTORY is inarray [*,2,0]. For aperture 2, the wavelength is in array [*,0,1]  HISTORY ,the flux is in array [*,1,1] and the error is in array [*,2,1]. Foror  HISTORY der 4, the flux for aperture 1 is in array [*,1,2], while the fluxfor   HISTORY aperture 2 is in array [*,1,3]. For order 5, the fluxes for thetwo ape  HISTORY rtures are in arrays [*,1,4] and [*,1,5], etc.  The spectrahave been c  HISTORY orrected for non-linearity.                                                                                                                              ############################## Xcombspec History ##############################A0VSTD  = 'HD_210501'          /   Tellluric Correction A0 V Standard           A0VBMAG =        7.73000000000 /   B-band magnitude                             A0VVMAG =        7.72000000000 /   V-band magnitude                             DAIRMASS=       0.345000000000 /   Average of (std-obj) airmass                 TELMETH = 'Deconvolution'      /   Telluric Correction Method                   VEGADV  =        808.738000000 /   Vega velocity shift in km s-1                TELFILE = 'BYW0011-0521B_tellspec.fits' /                                       TCMAXDEV=        2.43754000000 /   The maxmimum % deviation of Vega-data        TCRMSDEV=        1.04893000000 /   The RMS % deviation of Vega-model                                                                                            HISTORY   The files spectra00118.fits, spectra00119.fits, spectra00120.fits,    HISTORY spectra00121.fits, spectra00122.fits, spectra00123.fits,                HISTORY spectra00124.fits, spectra00125.fits, spectra00126.fits,                HISTORY spectra00127.fits were combined.    Aperture 01 Info:   The spectral    HISTORY shapes have been corrected.  The spectra were combined using a Robust   HISTORY Weighted Mean.  The robust threshold was 8.00000.                                                                                                        ############################### Xtellcor History ##############################                                                                                HISTORY This spectrum was telluric corrected using the telluric correction      HISTORY spectra BYW0011-0521B_tellspec.fits.  The velocity shift of Vega is     HISTORY 808.73800 km s-1.  The Vega model was modified using the                HISTORY deconvolution method.  The maximum deviation and rms deviation          HISTORY between the modified Vega model and the data over the kernel            HISTORY wavelength range are 2.4375400% and 1.0489300%, respectively.  The      HISTORY telluric correction spectra for aperture 01 were shifted by 0.00000     HISTORY pixels.                                                                 END                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             